        "title": "Narrative Semiotics: Greimas and Propp",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Narrative semiotics asks: is there a deep structure underlying all narratives? If signs function through relational systems of differences (Saussure), do narratives have an analogous underlying grammar that generates surface stories?"
    },
