        "title": "Narrative Semiotics: Greimas and Propp",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "This field draws on: Vladimir Propp's morphology of folk tales (1928), Algirdas Julien Greimas's structural semantics and actantial model (1966–1987), the structuralist tradition in anthropology (Lévi-Strauss), and later extensions toward discourse and social semiotics."
